# Private PlatformIO libraries

This directory is reserved for project-specific reusable firmware libraries. It is currently empty; the timing unit implementation lives in `../src/main.cpp` and third-party dependencies are declared in `../platformio.ini`.

To add a private library, place its source in its own directory, for example `lib/MyLibrary/src/MyLibrary.h` and `lib/MyLibrary/src/MyLibrary.cpp`. PlatformIO discovers and compiles it with the firmware build.
